			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 2 components\n\nSynchronize Maintain and Mist submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Maintain:**\n- Remove wildcard re-exports (pub use) from Rhai module (ConfigLoader, ScriptRunner, EnvironmentResolver) to enforce explicit module paths\n- Update CLI modules to import directly from ConfigLoader instead of re-exported items\n- Convert function calls from snake_case to PascalCase (e.g., ScriptRunner::execute_profile_script → ScriptRunner::ExecuteProfileScript)\n- Add missing fields (workbench_type, features) to test contexts for updated ConfigLoader API\n\n**Mist:**\n- Complete import path refactoring in integration tests\n- Change Mist:: prefixed paths to direct module imports (ForwardSecurity::default_forward_allowlist(), Zone::editor_land_zone())\n- Add clarifying comment about dns_port() dependency on Mist::start()\n\nThis coordinated update enforces explicit module encapsulation and aligns with CodeEditorLand PascalCase naming conventions.",
