			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 7 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Common, Grove, Mist, Mountain, Rest, and SideCar submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Refactoring & Encapsulation:**\n- Air: Expose HTTP Client module and update Mist crate naming to Mist (PascalCase)\n- Grove: Remove re-exports from mod.rs files, enforce explicit module paths, rename RuntimeBuildMod.rs→RuntimeBuild.rs\n- Mist: Rename library from \"mist\" to \"Mist\" and update all import paths\n- Mountain: Remove pub use re-exports from ApplicationState, Air, ExtensionScanner, PathResolution, Persistence, Recovery, and Serialization modules\n- Rest: Clean up unused imports and restructure test modules to inline nested modules\n\n**Style & Code Quality:**\n- Common: Add explicit type annotations in transport tests for better type inference clarity\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- SideCar: Fix Mist crate import path casing from lowercase \"mist\" to PascalCase \"Mist\"\n\nThis coordinated update enforces proper module encapsulation, aligns with PascalCase naming conventions, and fixes import path issues across the codebase.",
