			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 3 components\n\nSynchronize Air, Mountain, and Sky submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Style & Formatting:**\n- Air: Reformat dev_log macros and imports across 30+ modules, reorganizing from top-level to inline imports and expanding single-line to multi-line format.\n- Mountain: Standardize dev_log! macro formatting across ~150+ call sites in Air, ApplicationState, Binary, Environment, IPC, RPC, RunTime, Telemetry, and Vine modules.\n\n**Bug Fixes & Improvements:**\n- Mountain: Add .js.map 204 handling in vscode-file scheme handler for DevTools compatibility. Improve extension scanner logging for first-run scenarios (non-existent directory now debug-level). Add NLS placeholder resolution logging.\n\n**Features:**\n- Sky: Configure Open VSX extension gallery in product.json with marketplace endpoints, enabling extension browsing and installation.\n\n**Dependency Updates:**\n- Sky: Bump pnpm/action-setup 6.0.0 → 6.0.1, typescript 6.0.2 → 6.0.3\n\nThis coordinated update synchronizes formatting standards, fixes DevTools compatibility, and enables the Open VSX extension marketplace.",
